  "publisher": "Vernum Projecten B.V. (FerroBRIDGE)",
  "description": "Overrides ConceptMap/segment-sch-to-appointment of hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0. The guide maps SCH-26 and SCH-27 into basedOn(ServiceRequest), which creates a ServiceRequest, and ships no EI to ServiceRequest data type map to fill it. This supplement writes the placer order number (SCH-26) into basedOn[1].identifier and the filler order number (SCH-27) into basedOn[2].identifier, the logical reference FHIR R4 Reference.identifier defines, through the guide's EI to Identifier maps. Every other row is the guide's. Recorded on FerroBRIDGE #332 (#336).",
